Author: Glen Taggart <glenmtaggart@gmail.com>
Date:   Sun May 17 13:54:52 2026 -0700

    add class_swap strategy + decorator API for slotted generics
    
    Hand-merged check_edge_case 657dda3 onto dev.
    
    class_swap: a third opt-in for slotted classes needing instance-side
    @takes_alias/TypeVarValue. Child[int](...) swaps the instance's
    __class__ to a cached, per-parametrization __slots__=() subclass
    carrying _paramsight_alias. __slots__=() is layout-compatible with the
    origin, so it works on attrs @define/@frozen / @dataclass(slots=True) /
    manual __slots__ without a field and without weakref-ability.
    
    - _class_swap.py: synthetic-class cache, thread-local creation flag,
      pickle reconstructor (3-tuple __reduce__ delegating state I/O to the
      normal machinery; _synth_new is module-level so it's picklable)
    - _orig_class: "class_swap" added to _VALID_SLOT_STRATEGIES;
      get_orig_class also checks type(inst)._paramsight_alias; new
      uses_side_table / uses_class_swap class-decorator sugar (exported)
    - ga_proxy.__call__: class_swap branch slotted into dev's nit#1 chain
      (storage -> class_swap -> side_table -> defer)
    - aliasclassmethod: _patched_init_subclass skips synthetic creation
      (thread-local guard) so synthetics don't fire user __init_subclass__
      or re-install the proxy
    - tests: +10 (class_swap resolution/no-pollution/isinstance-vs-identity/
      no-bleed/evolve+copy+deepcopy+pickle/dataclass+manual slots/
      __init_subclass__ suppression/unparametrized fallback; decorator
      equivalence). Reintegrated onto get_args_at_base.
    - two scoped pyright ignores in _class_swap (dynamic origin[...]
      subscript and origin.__new__(origin) -- runtime-correct, unmodelable),
      consistent with the existing __class_getitem__/UnionType ignores
    
    Trade-off (documented): type(inst) is Cls becomes False for class_swap
    (isinstance stays True; name/qualname preserved). No field pollution;
    survives evolve/copy/pickle.
    
    ruff clean, pyright (src) 0/0/0, pytest 132 passed.
    
