   403	 """Slotted-class handling for ``@takes_alias`` / ``TypeVarValue``.
   404	 
   405	 A slotted class (``attrs.define`` / ``@frozen`` / ``@dataclass(slots=True)`` /
   406	 manual ``__slots__``) has no ``__dict__``, so CPython's
   407	 ``result.__orig_class__ = alias`` from the generic alias call silently fails.
